<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71361" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νωθ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sluggish, slothful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.559
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. κῶλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					819
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππος -έστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					30e
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. κίνησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					503b8
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ γόνατα νωθής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Luct.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			 ; of fire, <i>dull,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξύς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.9.3
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			) ; of earth, opp. water, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				86a
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the
			understanding, <i>dull, stupid,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεφαίνετο εἶναι -έστερος</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ παῖς</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.53
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νωθὴς τὸν νόον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				310e
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> neut.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νωθές</span> as Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.81
			</span></i> : 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έστατα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				59.4
			</span></i>.</div>
